# Feature 2: Build Configuration - COMPLETED

## Summary
Successfully implemented build configuration for LedgerLens KMP project.

## Changes Made

### 1. Created Version Catalog (gradle/libs.versions.toml)
- Defined versions for: kotlin (1.9.22), agp (8.2.0), compose (1.5.12), sqldelight (2.0.1), coroutines (1.7.3), serialization (1.6.2), datetime (0.5.0)
