### 2. Updated gradle.properties
- Added macOS experimental compose support flag: `org.jetbrains.compose.experimental.macos.enabled=true`

### 3. Updated settings.gradle.kts
- Added versionCatalogs configuration to enable libs.versions.toml usage

### 4. Updated android/build.gradle.kts
- Added signing configuration with environment/property-based credentials
