### 6. Updated android/proguard-rules.pro
- Added Kotlin metadata rules
- Added SQLDelight database class rules
- Added SQLCipher rules
- Added coroutines rules
- Added kotlinx-datetime rules
- Added Android Parcelable rules
- Added logging removal for release builds
- Added native methods preservation

### 7. Created desktop/proguard-rules.pro
- Mirror of Android ProGuard rules with desktop-specific additions
- Added Skiko (Compose Desktop rendering) rules
- Added JDBC/SQL rules for SQLite desktop support
- Added main entry point preservation

